   "source": [
    "## 6. Extrapolating LTV Beyond the Observed Window\n",
    "\n",
    "Cohorts that registered recently haven't had time to age into month 18, 24, etc., so the observed\n",
    "curve gets noisy and eventually runs out past the reliable sample threshold. To project a full\n",
    "12/24-month LTV for every channel, we:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Fit an **exponential decay** to the reliable portion of the retention curve (log-linear regression\n",
    "   → monthly survival multiplier).\n",
    "2. Take the **steady-state ARPU per active user per period** from the reliable window.\n",
    "3. Project forward: `retention(t) = retention(t_last) × decay^(t - t_last)`, and add\n",
    "   `retention(t) × steady_ARPU` to cumulative LTV for each future period."
   ]
  },
