    "## 7. Break-Even CAC by Channel\n",
    "\n",
    "Break-even CAC at a horizon *h* is simply `LTV(h)` — the most you could spend to acquire a user in\n",
    "that channel and still break even by month *h*. Most subscription businesses target a healthy\n",
    "margin, not just breakeven, so we also show the **max affordable CAC at a 3:1 LTV:CAC target**\n",
    "(a common SaaS benchmark) — i.e. `LTV(h) / 3`."
   ]
  },
